     "\n\n\n\n<div>\n<font face=\"Cambria\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Dear unmarked developers and users,<br>\n<br>\nWant to share a paper that I just published which was possible due to unmarked and lots of feedback from this community. The paper is  &quot;Community structure and diversity of tropical forest mammals: data from a global camera trap network&quot;. See links below. If anyone wants a copy of the paper, please send me an email and will get it to you.<br>\n<br>\nNow I am ready for colext!<br>\n   <br>\nURL:<br>\nAbstract:<br>\n<font color=\"#0000FF\"><u><a href=\"http://rstb.royalsocietypublishing.org/cgi/content/abstract/366/1578/2703?ijkey=nFcJxOnbbp6Xyho&amp;keytype=ref\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstb.royalsocietypublishing.org/cgi/content/abstract/366/1578/2703?ijkey%3DnFcJxOnbbp6Xyho%26keytype%3Dref&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792454419984000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ha1UbYYjLJp2v5P8q3nc6\">http://rstb.royalsocietypublishing.org/cgi/content/abstract/366/1578/2703?ijkey=nFcJxOnbbp6Xyho&amp;keytype=ref</a><br>\n</u></font><br>\nFull Text:<br>\n<font color=\"#0000FF\"><u><a href=\"http://rstb.royalsocietypublishing.org/cgi/content/full/366/1578/2703?ijkey=nFcJxOnbbp6Xyho&amp;keytype=ref\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstb.royalsocietypublishing.org/cgi/content/full/366/1578/2703?ijkey%3DnFcJxOnbbp6Xyho%26keytype%3Dref&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792454419984000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CYwK5TR9mdYXpEiQ_J5vB\">http://rstb.royalsocietypublishing.org/cgi/content/full/366/1578/2703?ijkey=nFcJxOnbbp6Xyho&amp;keytype=ref</a><br>\n</u></font><br>\nPDF:<br>\n<font color=\"#0000FF\"><u><a href=\"http://rstb.royalsocietypublishing.org/cgi/reprint/366/1578/2703?ijkey=nFcJxOnbbp6Xyho&amp;keytype=ref\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstb.royalsocietypu